DINEHUB - WE'VE RECORDED YOUR <%= @kind_label.upcase %> 

Hi <%= @reservation.full_name %>,

Thank you for reaching out. Your <%= @kind_label %> request has been recorded with our reservations team. Our team will contact you soon.

INQUIRY DETAILS
Guest: <%= @reservation.full_name %>
<% if @reservation.company.present? %>
Company: <%= @reservation.company %>
<% end %>
Date: <%= @reservation.reservation_date.to_date.strftime("%A, %B %-d, %Y") %>
Start time: <%= @reservation.parsed_start_time.strftime("%-l:%M %p") %>
Duration: <%= @reservation.duration %>
Guests: <%= @reservation.number_of_people %>
Budget per person: <%= number_to_currency(@reservation.budget_per_person) %>
Occasion: <%= @reservation.occasion %>
<% if @reservation.id.present? %>
Reference: #<%= @reservation.id %>
<% end %>
<% if @reservation.description.present? %>

NOTES
<%= @reservation.description %>
<% end %>

This is not a confirmed booking yet. Our team will contact you at <%= @reservation.email %> or <%= @reservation.phone %> to finalize the details.

We look forward to planning this with you.
DineHub Restaurant - Reservations Team
